From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 03:36:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] Refuse negative amounts, zero servings, over-long names
 and unbounded plan ranges

A 5000-character item name was a 500; -3 cups and 0-serving meals were
accepted; the dashboard plan endpoint would build megabytes of empty
days for ?days=100000.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
